  "description": "I've been in love with my first love for two years, and now he's marrying my best friend?\n\nTo hide my feelings, I lied and confessed to liking my boss... and he overheard me?!\n\nNow, deeply touched, my boss has decided to call off his engagement and marry me?!\n\nCan I possibly dodge the relentless charge of this runaway straight-shooter caught up in misunderstandings and delusions?!?\n\nLooks like I... really poked a sleeping bear!\n\n**Original Novel:**    \n[Chapters](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=12992292), [Volumes](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=13957647) \n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=854832), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14708854)",
